{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"846","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Math Show"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarp takes part in a math show. He is given "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" tasks, each consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" subtasks, numbered "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" through "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". It takes him "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"tj"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes to solve the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th subtask of any task. Thus, time required to solve a subtask depends only on its index, but not on the task itself. Polycarp can solve subtasks in any order."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"By solving subtask of arbitrary problem he earns one point. Thus, the number of points for task is equal to the number of solved subtasks in it. Moreover, if Polycarp "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"completely"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" solves the task (solves all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" of its subtasks), he recieves one extra point. Thus, total number of points he recieves for the complete solution of the task is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Polycarp has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"M"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes of time. What is the maximum number of points he can earn?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integer numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"M"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 45"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 45"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ M ≤ 2·109"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer numbers, values "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"tj"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ tj ≤ 1000000"},{"kind":"text","text":"), where "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"tj"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the time in minutes required to solve "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th subtask of any task."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the maximum amount of points Polycarp can earn in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"M"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 4 11\n1 2 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 5 10\n1 2 4 8 16\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Polycarp can complete the first task and spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 10"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. He also has the time to solve one subtask of the second task in one minute."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example Polycarp can solve the first subtask of all five tasks and spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5·1 = 5"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. Also he can solve the second subtasks of two tasks and spend "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2·2 = 4"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. Thus, he earns "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5 + 2 = 7"},{"kind":"text","text":" points in total."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"846B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/846/problem/B"}